sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web as React Web App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Product as Product/Inventory
    participant Cart as Cart
    participant Order as Order Service
    participant Delivery as Delivery Service

    User->>Web: Search product
    Web->>API: GET /api/products/search?q=milk
    API-->>Web: Product list
    User->>Web: Add product to cart
    Web->>API: POST /api/cart/items
    API->>Product: Validate product and stock
    Product-->>API: Available
    API-->>Web: Updated cart
    User->>Web: Place order
    Web->>API: POST /api/orders
    API->>Order: Validate cart and reserve stock
    Order-->>API: Order created
    API->>Delivery: Request delivery assignment (target architecture)
    API-->>Web: 201 Created + order ID
    User->>Web: Track delivery
    Web->>API: GET /api/orders/{id}/delivery-status
    API-->>Web: Current delivery status
